            "id": "part-3-group-2",
            "type": "matching",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 27–30</h3><p>What comment is made about the programme for each of the following shows?</p><p>Choose <strong>FOUR</strong> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <strong>A–F</strong>, next to Questions 27–30.</p><p><strong>Comments about programme</strong></p>",
            "wordBank": [
              {
                "letter": "A",
